MHOverlay is an independent REFramework overlay. It is not an official HunterPie
port and does not include HunterPie source code, artwork, icons or branding.
No code or assets from Nexus Mods MHWilds Overlay (mod 81) or CatLib are included.

Monster portraits and six consumable icons in mhoverlay/artwork.lua were converted
from the two images supplied by the user for this overlay. They depict Monster
Hunter Wilds artwork, whose rights belong to CAPCOM and/or its respective owners.
They are not original MHOverlay artwork and are not covered by the MIT licenses
below. No permission to redistribute that artwork is asserted by this project.
The reduced palette/transparent sprite conversion does not transfer ownership.

The blue and red flat-bottom drink flask sprites (cool_drink and hot_drink)
are original MHOverlay drawings, not resources from the user-supplied sheets.
The stat_* sprites for the horizontal hunter-stat strip are also original
MHOverlay pixel drawings, not official game icons.

Monster names and EnemyDef.ID field associations were checked against:
https://mhwilds.kiranico.com/data/monsters
https://github.com/Synthlight/MHWilds-Dumped-Data/blob/master/Enemy%20IDs.csv
Only identifier/name associations are used; no reference-site images are bundled.

